type: software
title: "Pebble: A Lightweight Always-On-Top AI Desktop Overlay"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-16"
authors:
  - family-names: Ghosh
    given-names: Ranasurya
repository-code: https://github.com/NuclearVenom/Pebble
url: https://github.com/NuclearVenom/Pebble
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Pebble is a minimal, always-on-top desktop AI overlay built with Tauri and
  plain HTML/CSS/JS. It surfaces a Groq-powered AI assistant as a transparent
  floating capsule, activated globally with Alt+Space. Pebble supports streamed
  responses, rich content rendering (math, chemistry, diagrams, plots, maps,
  3D structures, and more), multi-turn chat mode, persistent chat history,
  web search, and automatic in-app updates.
keywords:
  - AI
  - desktop overlay
  - Tauri
  - Groq
  - assistant
  - always-on-top
  - Rust
